sequenceDiagram
  participant Y as Your shielded ZEC
  participant N as NEAR Intents
  participant F as Fresh wallet
  participant V as Venue
  Note over Y: A random moment,<br/>never at a deposit or app open
  Y->>N: One standard amount (0.01 … 1 ZEC),<br/>fresh shielded refund address
  N->>F: USDC or SOL (confidential swap),<br/>Polymarket's bridge turns USDC into pUSD
  F->>V: One position, signed by its own key<br/>(on Polymarket Perps, by its proxy)
  V->>F: Close
  F->>N: Proceeds, whatever the wallet holds
  N->>Y: Back to a fresh shielded address
  Note over F,V: A copy trader finds one funding,<br/>one trade, no history
